---
// Go compiler optimization passes: Inlining, Bounds Check Elimination (BCE), and Escape Analysis.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="ge9b">
  <div class="ge9b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three Go compiler optimization passes verified with go build gcflags: function inlining, Bounds Check Elimination via subslice hints, and stack versus heap escape analysis.">
      {/* Top strip: 3 compiler cards side by side */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="280" height="254" rx="10" class="ge9b-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge9b-h">1. Function Inlining</text>
      <rect x="30" y="60" width="248" height="70" rx="6" class="ge9b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="42" y="80" class="ge9b-b-ok">go build -gcflags="-m"</text>
      <text x="42" y="100" class="ge9b-m">can inline InlineAdd</text>
      <text x="42" y="116" class="ge9b-m">inlining call to InlineAdd</text>
      <rect x="30" y="142" width="248" height="110" rx="6" class="ge9b-box" />
      <text x="42" y="164" class="ge9b-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why Inlining amplifies wins:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sức mạnh dây chuyền của Inlining:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="184" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Pastes small bodies into caller loop;</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dán thẳng thân hàm nhỏ vào caller,</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="202" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>removes CALL stack overhead AND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>giúp trình biên dịch thấy cả vòng lặp</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="220" class="ge9b-m">unlocks dead-code &amp; stack opts.</text>

      <rect x="310" y="14" width="280" height="254" rx="10" class="ge9b-card is-ok" />
      <text x="326" y="42" class="ge9b-h">2. Bounds Check Elim (BCE)</text>
      <rect x="326" y="60" width="248" height="70" rx="6" class="ge9b-box is-red" />
      <text x="338" y="80" class="ge9b-b-red">SumEveryFourth: 4 IsInBounds</text>
      <text x="338" y="100" class="ge9b-m">s[i]+s[i+1]+s[i+2]+s[i+3]</text>
      <text x="338" y="116" class="ge9b-m">4 range checks emitted per step!</text>
      <rect x="326" y="142" width="248" height="110" rx="6" class="ge9b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="338" y="164" class="ge9b-b-ok">Hint: win := s[i:i+4]; _ = win[3]</text>
      <text x="338" y="184" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Proves win[0..3] safe once at top.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chứng minh trước với _ = win[3] là</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="338" y="202" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Check via: check_bce/debug=1.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Go tự xóa sạch cả 4 phép kiểm tra thừa!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="338" y="220" class="ge9b-m">Zero redundant bounds checks left!</text>

      <rect x="606" y="14" width="280" height="254" rx="10" class="ge9b-card" />
      <text x="622" y="42" class="ge9b-h">3. Escape Analysis (Stack vs Heap)</text>
      <rect x="622" y="60" width="248" height="70" rx="6" class="ge9b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="634" y="80" class="ge9b-b-ok">s does not escape → Fast Stack</text>
      <text x="634" y="100" class="ge9b-m">Freed automatically on func return.</text>
      <text x="634" y="116" class="ge9b-m">Zero GC mark/sweep tax later!</text>
      <rect x="622" y="142" width="248" height="110" rx="6" class="ge9b-box is-red" />
      <text x="634" y="164" class="ge9b-b-red">moved to heap: onHeap</text>
      <text x="634" y="184" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Returning &amp;x, storing into interface,</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trả con trỏ &amp;x, bọc qua any/interface,</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="634" y="202" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>or dynamic make size forces Heap.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>hay cấp slice kích thước động sẽ đẩy</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="634" y="220" class="ge9b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Every heap alloc bills GC twice.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>biến ra Heap và tốn chi phí GC.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go 1.27's SSA backend exposes inlining, Bounds Check Elimination (-d=ssa/check_bce/debug=1), and stack-versus-heap escape decisions with zero guesswork (-gcflags="-m").</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trình biên dịch Go 1.27 in rõ ba quyết định tối ưu quan trọng ngay lúc build (-gcflags="-m"): gộp hàm nhỏ (inlining), bỏ kiểm tra vượt mảng (BCE) và biến nào nằm trên Stack hay bị đẩy ra Heap.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge9b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge9b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge9b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge9b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge9b-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge9b-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge9b-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge9b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge9b-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge9b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge9b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge9b-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge9b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge9b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge9b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge9b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge9b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge9b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
